{"about_the_game":"You play as a peculiar clumsy commando, sent to fight a horde of zombies in a jungle bunkers area. The hero resembles Rambo, but without the brains, the brawn and the survival skills... Ok, he only slightly resembles Rambo...<br>Your actions will cause harm to your enemies as to yourself. Accidents happen often and tend to have serious consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/ed00229468e7f09fa632365f5eac0c97.poster.avif?t=1728513091\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/ed00229468e7f09fa632365f5eac0c97.webm?t=1728513091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/ed00229468e7f09fa632365f5eac0c97.mp4?t=1728513091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blind and armed, you cannot simply aim or move, only a convenient situation gives you the chance to effectively annihilate your opponent! Then even a blind shot becomes a deadly one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/50648a5c58f24d83ec39fec8236c77a5.poster.avif?t=1728513091\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/50648a5c58f24d83ec39fec8236c77a5.webm?t=1728513091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488620/extras/50648a5c58f24d83ec39fec8236c77a5.mp4?t=1728513091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect coins, earn money, not only to buy new guns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea